## Pre-Generation Hypothesis Review Complete

**Summary**: Reviewed [N] draft hypotheses

**Decisions**:
- KEEP: [N] hypotheses (IDs: ...)
- REVISE: [N] hypotheses (IDs: ...) - See suggestions
- REJECT: [N] hypotheses (IDs: ...) - Must regenerate

