ToolCalls:
  1. {'name': 'write', 'args': {'file_path': 'reports/fig2b_spatial_scatter_report.md', 'contents': "# Title & Objective\n\nReproduce the Lohoff et al. seqFISH Fig. 2b-style spatial scatterplot from `dataset_lohoff_et_al_seqfish.h5ad`, placing each cell at its spatial location, coloring cells by annotated cell type, and inverting the y-axis to match the supplied reference image (`Fig2b.jpg`).\n\n# Data & Methods\n\n- **Input dataset:** `library/datasets/dataset_lohoff_et_al_seqfish.h5ad`\n- **Reference image:** `project/uploads/Fig2b.jpg` (592 × 784 px)\n- **Spatial coordinates:** `adata.obsm['spatial']`\n- **Cell-type annotation:** `adata.obs['celltype_mapped_refined']`\n- **Rendered cells:** 17,771 cells after excluding 1,645 cells labelled `Low quality`, because that class is not present in the reference legend.\n- **Orientation:** plotted with the y-axis inverted (`ax.invert_yaxis()`), matching the reference image-coordinate orientation.\n- **Styling:** colors were measured from the reference legend and stored in `tables/colormap.yaml`; the panel label, scale bar, compass, legend order, and canvas dimensions were matched to the reference crop as closely as supported by the AnnData object.\n\n# Results\n\n- Created the requested spatial scatterplot in PNG and PDF format.\n- Final accepted render: **attempt 5**.\n- Comparison to the supplied reference improved across iterations:\n  - pHash Hamming distance: **12 → 6** (lower is better)\n  - SSIM: **0.5891 → 0.7188** (higher is better)\n  - ORB good matches: **156 → 186** (higher is better)\n- Orientation testing favored the rendered orientation `as_is`; vertical and horizontal flips scored worse, supporting the requested inverted y-axis.\n- The final plot retains reference-only legend entries (`Blood progenitors`, `Caudal mesoderm`, `ExE endoderm`) for visual fidelity, but no points were plotted for them because those categories are absent from the dataset.\n\n![Reproduced Fig. 2b-style spatial scatterplot](../figures/fig2b_spatial_scatter.png)\n\n# Caveats & Warnings\n\n- `Low quality` cells (1,645 observations) were excluded to match the reference legend; the output is therefore not a plot of every cell in the AnnData object.\n- The scale bar is a visual/layout annotation matched to the reference crop; source spatial coordinates are normalized, so it was not recalibrated as a physical distance directly from the h5ad file.\n- The comparison script still reports a palette delta-E warning despite legend-derived colors; this is attributed to dense JPEG compression and anti-aliased scatter blending in the reference image rather than a known category-color mismatch.\n- The reference crop contains partial lower-left neighboring-panel content that was intentionally not reproduced because it is outside the requested spatial scatterplot and not represented in the supplied AnnData object.\n- Minor residual differences remain in JPEG texture, anti-aliasing, and exact font metrics.\n\n# Next Steps\n\n- Use `figures/fig2b_spatial_scatter.png` for raster display and `figures/fig2b_spatial_scatter.pdf` for publication/vector workflows.\n- If an exact physical scale bar is required, provide the spatial-coordinate-to-micrometer calibration for this dataset.\n- If all AnnData observations must be shown, rerun the plot with the `Low quality` category included and assign it an explicit color/legend entry.\n\n# References\n\n- No DOI/PMID metadata was provided in the staged files for this plotting-only task.\n\n# Artifacts\n\n- Main figure PNG: `project/outputs/figures/fig2b_spatial_scatter.png`\n- Main figure PDF: `project/outputs/figures/fig2b_spatial_scatter.pdf`\n- Plotting data table: `project/outputs/tables/fig2b_spatial_scatter_plot_data.csv`\n- Cell-type colormap: `project/outputs/tables/colormap.yaml`\n- Comparison metrics: `project/outputs/tables/compare_metrics.json`\n- Difference/comparison image: `project/outputs/figures/compare_diff.png`\n- Reproduction note: `project/outputs/reports/fig2b_spatial_scatter_repro_note.md`\n", 'mode': 'overwrite'}, 'id': 'call_45l1UecQzJq4A26K4hF0Eqrn', 'type': 'tool_call'}

